      "id": "teach_5_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Divide numerator and denominator by y². Let r=x/y=7/3.\n\n(r+1)/(r²−1) = (10/3)/(40/9) = 3/4.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
